# ******************************************************************
# Program     : .dockerignore
# Application : CardDemo
# Type        : Docker build context exclusion rules
# Function    : Keeps the context `docker build` uploads small and
#               deterministic, without dropping any source, frozen
#               contract, fixture, migration or evidence artefact the
#               Maven build and the validation gates depend on.
# Source      : samples/jcl/{BATCMP,CICCMP,BMSCMP}.jcl,
#               samples/proc/{BUILDBAT,BUILDBMS,BUILDONL}.prc and
#               samples/m2/** (z/OS build tooling and binary emulator
#               runtime archives, superseded by pom.xml) +
#               app/data/EBCDIC/** (codepage reference, never parsed)
#               @ 7756d89 - the only two content trees excluded below
# ******************************************************************
# Copyright Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates.
# All Rights Reserved.
